# G12: a reverse flag is applied by its presence.
-- options --
mydumper-version: v0.19.3-3
-- input.cnf --
[mydumper]
tz-utc=0
-- fixed-unsafe.cnf --
[mydumper]
#tz-utc=0
-- diagnostics --
2:8-2:9 error MDL402[boolean-flag-value] `tz-utc=0` turns tz-utc on: the option takes no value, so GLib ignores `0`
  = tz-utc takes effect, the opposite of what `0` says.
  fix (unsafe): Comment the line out to leave the option off
